{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31737","headline":"酬栖上人 · 贾岛","name":"酬栖上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜久城馆闲，情幽出在山。\n新月有微辉，朗朗空庭间。\n处世虽识机，伊余多掩关。\n松姿度腊见，篱药知春还。\n静览冰雪词，厚爲酬赠颜。\n东林有踯躅，脱屣期共攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}